    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1811">

                <pb facs="1323" n="1207" xml:id="pg1207"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 319.1123L25/10.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister Price.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 163.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department has received your No. 552,
                    of the 9th instant, in which you report that you vigorously protested against
                    the release of the Panaman policeman who is charged with the murder of Corporal
                    Langdon and the shooting of Private Deloughery during the riot in Colon on April
                    2 last.</p>
                <p>The Department approves your action in the matter.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
